 The inclusion of 
\shape italic
LeagueId
\shape default
 and 
\shape italic
SeasonPhase
\shape default
 allows the model to account for competitive context and seasonal variations.
 To avoid information leakage and better reflect a real-world deployment scenario,
 the dataset was partitioned chronologically,
 with earlier seasons used for training and later matches reserved exclusively for testing.
